# Plugin: Brainstorming Adapter

Purpose:
  Adapt Superpowers brainstorming skill for SDDRA P1 arm.

Source:
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\vkard.az\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\brainstorming\SKILL.md

Original:
  Three paths: Spike, Bounded, Architectural
  Human approval gate before implementation

Adapted for SDDRA:
  Paths map to chain types:
    Spike -> P1 (quick analysis)
    Bounded -> D1 (docs generation)
    Architectural -> D1 + S1 (full docs + sdd)

  Approval gate maps to human gates:
    P1->D1: docs approval
    D1->S1: sdd approval
    S1->C1: code approval

  Red Flags table adapted for SDDRA context:
    - "This is too simple to need .sdd/" -> False, minimum .sdd required
    - "I'll skip decision ledger" -> False, decisions required
    - "Token budget is too tight" -> False, minimum context required

Usage:
  Referenced by:
    .sdd/chains/arms/prompt.sdd
    .sdd/chains/arms/docs.sdd

  Triggers:
    - Human submits prompt
    - Classification needed
    - Design refinement needed

State: Adapted
